			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6e8d2632-d3d5-5ad0-bdb8-e6d91d19b489")
	)
	(text_box "20 x 1.99 Mohm TNPV1206 (0.1 %, 25 ppm/K, < 1 ppm/V) + bottom leg 2 x 79.6 kohm TNPW1206 in parallel: ratio (39.8 M + 39.8 k)/39.8 k = 1,001. DEPARTURE: the contract names 12 x 3.32 Mohm TNPV1206, but TNPV1206 stops at 2.0 Mohm\n(datasheet 28881, 29-Apr-2026); same total resistance, 109 V per element. Shares no part, maker or footprint row with the main string or the bleeder (D-28). Tap clamp as the main string."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 753.77 31.75 0)
		(size 267.56 6.318)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ca8a0885-404a-59b9-9b32-a31ab26191c6")
	)
	(text_box "STACK A (held off only by the MAIN): dump resistors R1101-R1103 + Q1101 (bottom) ... Q1104 (top), sharing string, gate clamps"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 90.265 0)
		(size 265.74 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2fe4fa37-9805-54a6-be43-509350203ffc")
	)
	(text_box "Normally ON: with no gate bias every IXTT10N100D2 conducts (VGS = 0, RDS(on) 1.5 ohm) and the capacitor empties through 3 x 1.5 kohm. Static sharing: 4 x 10 Mohm string across the stack; the gate of each upper device goes through 100\nkohm to the tap below its source, so each upper device is a source follower of its tap and every device blocks V/4 (545 V at 2,182 V) whatever its leakage. Dynamic sharing: 3.3 nF / 2 kV C0G across each string resistor (>= 10 x Coss\n300 pF). Every gate has a 15 V bidirectional TVS to its own source; upper gates also have 10 Mohm gate-source so an open 100 kohm leaves a defined VGS = 0 (device conducts). FINDING F-1 (WP-F.md): with tap-referenced followers a\nSHORTED device puts the device below it (or above, for the top one) at V/2 = 1,091 V at 2,182 V, above the 1,000 V rating; the design's 727 V figure assumes redistribution that this topology does not do."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 96.615 0)
		(size 265.74 10.636)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "90a177db-f112-524a-a96b-52b1e4d3657d")
	)
	(text_box "Stack A hold: HOLD_A_DRV -> 4-stage pump -> bottom gate STKA_G; release switch Q1109; held opto U1101 -> HOLD_A_HELD_N"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 311.46 112.378 0)
		(size 260.91 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6f48458d-b266-5b88-ad7a-516d2bbb352d")
	)
	(text_box "Everything here is referenced to HV_RTN at the stack and coupled to the GND side only through the pump capacitors and the optocoupler (R-9). Pump: 4-stage single-clock Dickson-type (pump capacitors driven in parallel from the\nclock, hold capacitors to HV_RTN), BAT54S Schottky pairs, 2.2 uF / 25 V; output -7.4 V (cold, 3.1 V clock, 1 kHz) to -9.3 V [SIM, behavioural]. DEPARTURE: design says 3 stages; a 3-stage single-clock pump is below -7.0 V even\nunloaded at the cold corner (WP-F.md). Reservoir 3.3 uF. Gate-source 680 k + 330 k (1.01 Mohm) with test point at the 1/3 tap. Release: P-channel JFET pilot Q1112 (normally ON, source HV_RTN) is pinched off only while a 3-stage\npositive BAV199 pump (referenced to HV_RTN, so the moving gate node cannot pump it) biases its gate; when the clock stops the bias bleeds away (tau 4 ms; every inner pump node is bled too), the pilot conducts and turns on Q1109\n(BSS138, source STKA_G) from the reservoir's own charge. DEPARTURE D-3: a gate-referenced depletion release (BSS126/BSS139) was simulated and either would not stay off at 1 kHz or was pumped back off by the rising gate node\n(WP-F.md). Held sense: HV_RTN - 3.9 k - 4.7 V zener - TLP187 LED (22 k across it) - STKA_G: LED lit only when the gate is below about -5.5..-7.0 V; Darlington pulls HOLD_A_HELD_N low (10 k pull-up on 09). Open, unlit or unpowered =\nhigh = not held."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 311.46 118.728 0)
		(size 260.91 17.113)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "450a69e7-8c95-5f8a-aa33-4ef36c890ee8")
	)
